[signal arg="look_at_leticia"]
set {NPCs.killer_name} = "?"
killer: Leticia![pause=0.5] What a coincidence to see you here.
[signal arg="leticia_walk_in"]
[wait time="3.5"]
killer: Were you with your friends?
- Who are you?
	Leticia: (He looks familiar) Who are you?
set {NPCs.killer_name} = "Neighbor"
killer: You remember your dad's friend? That's me,[pause=0.5] I'm just a few houses away from yours so we're neighbors.
killer: Do you need a ride home?
- Yes
	Leticia: I'd appreciate that, thank you.
	[signal arg="get_in_car"]
	[end_timeline]
- No
	Leticia: No thank you.
killer: It’s getting dark,[pause=0.5] I- [pause=0.5]your dad wouldn’t want anything to happen to you. Am I right?
- Refuse to get in the car
	Leticia: I'll just get a cab home.
- Get in the car
	[signal arg="get_in_car"]
	[end_timeline]
killer: Are you sure? You’re gonna get home much quicker if I give you a ride.
- Yes, I'm sure
	Leticia: Yes, I can take a cab home. I'll be alright.
	killer: Come, let's get you home.
	[signal arg="get_in_car"]
	Leticia: (My body is moving on it's own. I don't want to get in the car.)[aa]
	[end_timeline]
- Get in the car
	[signal arg="get_in_car"]
	[end_timeline]